\ Regression for the jitNativeWordCall leaf-call fix: a dot-qualified,
\ module-private native (`native.virtual-struct-wrap`, called from the
\ compiled body of a `virtual{ }` type's `>NAME` wrap constructor) is never
\ entered into the global dictionary, so it cannot be resolved through the
\ leaf cache populated at process startup. jitNativeWordCall must still
\ reach it correctly through its slow-path dictionary/module-scan fallback.

weight: virtual{ fixnum } ;

7 >weight unmake-weight .
